window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A harrowing battle on Myan Station let me with a mysterious starship and three beautiful crew members.</b></p> <p>Together, we’ve been roaming the galaxy in search of people who needed our help. It’s not much in the grand scheme of things, but it’s helping to restore some of the honor I lost after working for a mob boss for the better part of my life.</p> <p>After what seems a run of the mill mission, I discover that the voidtouched and the anjelica have a history. They share a dark secret, one which could lead to the destruction of not only my starship and her crew, but also the entire universe.</p> <p>To save everything I hold dear, I’ll need to face enemies I thought I’d never see again, and delve ever deeper into what it means to be an esper.</p>"; 
